     "destination": "Ionian Islands, Greece (Corfu, Paxos, Lefkada)",
     "country": "Greece",
     "days": 15,
     "summary": "Sophie's 15-day Ionian route: Corfu 7 days (Corfu Town, boat trips, Porto Timoni, southern beaches, Pantokrator), Paxos 3 days (Day 1 arrival, Day 2 boat circle, Day 3 scooter explore), Lefkada 5 days (west coast beaches, Karya village, sunsets, boat tours).",
     "confidence": "high",
     "source_urls": [
      "https://www.tiktok.com/@tzatchickie/video/7610847293901688097"
     ],
     "items": [
      {
       "day": 1,
       "name": "Corfu - Corfu Town and island highlights",
       "location": "Corfu, Greece",
       "item_type": "activity",
       "details": "7 days on Corfu. Corfu Town alleys and Venetian vibe. Boat rental in Liapades or Paleokastritsa for turquoise bays. Hike to Porto Timoni via Afionas. Southern beaches: Halikouna, Marathias, Notos, Petriti. Erimitis nature reserve, Kassiopi, Akoli. Pantokrator summit, Old Perithia lunch. Aqualand, Moonlight Cinema beach cinema. Dinners at Ambelonas, Etrusco, village taverns.",
       "booking_link": null,
       "price_hint": null
      },
      {
       "day": 8,
       "name": "Paxos - Day 1 arrival",
       "location": "Paxos, Greece",
       "item_type": "other",
       "details": "Ferry from Corfu Town to Paxos (or bus to Lefkimmi then ferry). Day 1: arrival and slow exploring, chill at an organised beach.",
       "booking_link": null,
       "price_hint": null
      },
      {
       "day": 9,
       "name": "Paxos - Day 2 boat circle",
       "location": "Paxos, Greece",
       "item_type": "activity",
       "details": "Day 2: rent a boat, circle the island, hidden caves and bays, Voutoumi beach. Dock in Lakka, Loggos, or Gaios for lunch.",
       "booking_link": null,
       "price_hint": null
      },
      {
       "day": 10,
       "name": "Paxos - Day 3 scooter explore",
       "location": "Paxos, Greece",
       "item_type": "activity",
       "details": "Day 3: explore by scooter or car. Colourful churches, olive groves, beaches. Walk down to Erimitis beach.",
       "booking_link": null,
       "price_hint": null
      },
      {
       "day": 11,
       "name": "Lefkada - west coast beaches",
       "location": "Lefkada, Greece",
       "item_type": "activity",
       "details": "5 days on Lefkada. Ferry from Paxos (3x weekly, Lefkada Palace). West coast beaches: Kathisma, Milos (hike from Agios Nikitas or boat taxi), Egremni, Porto Katsiki. Boat tours from Vasiliki. Karya village lunch under plane trees. Sunset spots: Rachi, Amente, Utopia. Paragliding. Boat tour around surrounding islands. Lefkada Town evening stroll. Avali beach.",
       "booking_link": null,
       "price_hint": null
      }
     ]
    }
